 '## Final groups and eligibility','',paste(GROUPS,collapse=', '),'- Final 14 groups only; generic Fibro/Pericyte are absent. Cycling lineage unresolved: 7,324 excluded. Frozen earlier stromal exclusions: 1,922 inherited exactly from historical barcode lists. Final fibro cells: 20,146.', '- 59 biological samples in 5 datasets. Each orig.ident maps to exactly one dataset; no sample identifiers collide across datasets. Biological sample replication is retained in every input.', '- No patient_uid or patient identifier is present. Patients are UNKNOWN; long-table patient_uid values are NA. Sample-level replication cannot establish patient independence.', '',markdown_table(coverage),'',
